Package: gts
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: sane-utils
Description: Ghibli Tracing System - scan drawings for animation (Quirinux Edition)
 GTS scans hand-drawn animation drawings through SANE and traces them
 (line-art cleanup, colour trace) into TIFF or Targa images.
 .
 This is the Quirinux Edition of opentoonz/GTS. It calls sane_cancel()
 after each finished scan and before sane_close(), which fixes a freeze
 on the second scan with some backends such as Brother brother4
 (brscan4), and it builds with current SANE (pkg-config) and GCC.
